  "decision": "Retain HSA_SCRATCH_SINGLE_LIMIT=33554432 as a gfx1100 process-start default. It removes the unused 108-MiB portion of ROCr's reserved single-dispatch scratch threshold without changing the 300-MiB use-once AOTriton allocation, tracked hipEngine ownership, kernel math, decode/MTP, or explicit user policy. Clean XTX and W7900 gates are exact and move every throughput median by at most 0.104%. Vulkan memory parity remains open at 0.233/0.376/0.758/0.759 GiB for 512/1K/4K/8K."
